    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687000/extras/fc411c1f7a2df5d679c23914927f3d75.poster.avif?t=1750021359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687000/extras/fc411c1f7a2df5d679c23914927f3d75.apng?t=1750021359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>You play as Seiji Maruyama, a middle-aged yakuza recently released from prison. Old tropes are here but you can choose to not follow them. The question is \u2014 does anything really matter that much now?<br><br>The game features:<br>- Multi-endings;<br>- Complex beat'em up action;<br>- Mini-games;<br>- City to explore.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687000/extras/fc411c1f7a2df5d679c23914927f3d75.poster.avif?t=1750021359\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1687000/extras/fc411c1f7a2df5d679c23914927f3d75.apng?t=1750021359\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br>You play as Seiji Maruyama, a middle-aged yakuza recently released from prison. Old tropes are here but you can choose to not follow them. The question is \u2014 does anything really matter that much now?<br><br>The game features:<br>- Multi-endings;<br>- Complex beat'em up action;<br>- Mini-games;<br>- City to explore.",
    "short_description": "Seiji Maruyama is a middle-aged yakuza recently released from prison. Known as &quot;Gozuki&quot; (one of the demon generals from Buddhist mythology) he is the power that his oyabun counts on. But there is one thing his aniki is not taking into account: Maruyama is getting old.",
    "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil, Korean, French",
    "reviews": "\u201cYeo is trying to make use of the poetics of the videogame form rather than draw on storytelling methods from books or movies.\u201d<br>85/100 \u2013 RPGFan<br>",
